WEBVTT

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:28.360
The pillow I possess is so wretched indeed...

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:31.030
Another trip for us humble boxers, huh?

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:34.150
We're in the East today, and tomorrow, the South!

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:39.450
The crows are cawing, and flying away!

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:40.090
B-Boss!

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.410
Sure is sad...

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:44.500
Yeah...

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:46.540
What the hell are you doing!?

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:50.010
We've got a tight schedule to keep, so make it quick!

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:53.260
Our next host is waiting for us!

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:54.470
Well, you got that?

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:55.550
Yeah, yeah.

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:58.890
Hey, have you boys seen Yabuki around?

00:01:58.890 --> 00:02:01.100
Some lucky woman just sent him a postcard.

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:02.400
Lemme see!

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:05.520
Nope! Not showing you!

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:06.310
Come on, show us!

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:07.480
Let us see it!

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:29.340
What's with that look?

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:31.750
You shouldn't be making such a fuss over someone else's postcard!

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:34.840
That's easy for you to say, but I want one, too!

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:38.240
I haven't had a postcard in years!

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:40.720
There, there...

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:02.210
Carlos...

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:12.920
Joe!

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.090
Joe, we're leaving now.

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:18.560
Old man Kono's starting to fret.

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:25.440
Oh, and you also got a postcard.

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:42.700
<i>How are you, Yabuki-kun?</i>

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:46.000
<i>It's been a while since you left.</i>

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:50.090
<i>Without you, the slums feel like an entirely different place.</i>

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:54.300
<i>The children are all misbehaving,</i>

00:03:54.960 --> 00:04:01.050
<i>and old man Danpei went back to blowing the money from his day jobs on liquor.</i>

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:18.110
Here, Noriko-san, let me give you a ride!

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:19.160
No, it's all right!

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:22.100
Nishi-kun?

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:25.570
I saw old man Danpei at the construction site yesterday.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:29.750
But he's starting to look really sad.

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:32.450
And the children are still restless...

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:34.960
Maybe you could pay him a visit?

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:36.750
Goodbye!

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:53.980
Oh, shit!

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:56.580
Oh, no! Is he okay?

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:57.400
<i>Kinoko! Hang on!</i>

00:04:58.150 --> 00:04:59.690
Come on, Kinoko! Stay with us!

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:01.400
He got hit by a car!

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:03.700
<i>It hurts! Mommy!</i>

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:08.370
Well don't just stand there, asshole!

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:09.650
You ran him over!

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:13.250
So what're you gonna do about this, Pops?

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:15.920
I'm so sorry, but I did honk my horn and...

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:18.130
Honking the horn doesn't solve anything, moron!

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:21.130
You're right. Well, we'd better get him to a hospital...

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.760
Don't you touch him!

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:29.810
You were going to dispose of him somewhere instead of taking him to a hospital!

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:31.980
No, of course not! I would never...

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:33.020
Oh, really now?

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:35.610
Then forget the hospital and fork over the medical fees!

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:39.070
Let's settle this out of court!

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:39.770
Out of court!

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:43.280
Or do you want us to report you to the police?

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:44.570
No, anything but that...

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:45.990
Well, what's it gonna be?

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:47.280
Hey, what are you kids doing?

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:49.280
M-Mammoth...

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.830
Oh, what are you doing sleeping in the middle of the road?

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:54.630
Come on, get up!

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:58.290
Stop misbehaving and get up!

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:05.050
Oh, so you got in an accident here?

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:06.300
Well, that's a real shame...

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.300
Oh, uh, yeah...

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:11.930
See, for some reason, kids tend to get hit by cars in this area a lot.

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:16.100
Damn Mammoth...

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:17.310
Goddammit!

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:22.820
Here, just let me handle this.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:25.240
I'm more familiar with the kids around here, you see.

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:26.740
So just carry on. Don't worry about a thing.

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:29.370
Oh, thank you! How can I ever repay you?

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:31.280
Never mind that, just move along!

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:32.720
Thank you! Goodbye!

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.300
You kids will never change!

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:44.210
You're not even slightly apologetic!

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:47.390
Tarou, don't come running to me if you really get run over!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:49.970
As if!

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:51.680
We're only doing this because we're bored!

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:52.430
Isn't that right?

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:53.470
Yeah!

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:55.180
It's a good distraction.

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:57.180
Distraction?

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:01.190
Now that Bro Joe's gone, we have nothing to do.

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.650
J-Joe, you say?

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:06.740
What're you talking about?

00:07:06.740 --> 00:07:09.700
You know how sad he'd be if he found out about this?

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:12.660
You do realize that Joe taught us how to do this.

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:14.460
Huh?

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:17.960
O-Oh, you're right.

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:22.960
If you kids want an allowance, you can always come to me.

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:26.430
Next time you decide to fake an accident, you'll have to answer to me!

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:30.010
Hey, how much is it?

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:33.890
One, two, three, four...

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:35.010
Did you hear me!?

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:39.810
What the hell is wrong with them?

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:43.520
Why did everything turn to hell so soon after Joe left?

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:48.070
Take that, Mammoth, you big dummy!

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:14.220
Are you still worried about Joe?

00:08:20.480 --> 00:08:24.230
If you've got something on your mind, why not let it out?

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:28.980
I'm sure the kids would be glad if you found out how Joe's doing.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.450
All right, guess I'll do it.

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:35.910
Yes, that's it! That'll be better for you, old man!

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:38.120
Now go on and represent all of us!

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:39.160
Okay, old man?

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:42.660
Represent all of us?

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:45.620
Here!

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:48.120
All right.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:08.440
Hey, Ina-chan, doesn't Joe look a little down to you?

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:26.340
Come one, come all! We're about to get started!

00:09:26.340 --> 00:09:29.000
You're about to see raw action that you can't find on TV!

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:31.710
This is our grand opening at this location,

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:33.970
and you're about to see the match of the century!

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:36.390
Come one, come all!

00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:47.020
Hey, Joe! You're up!

00:09:55.870 --> 00:09:57.530
Pull yourself together, Joe!

00:09:57.530 --> 00:09:58.450
I said you're up!

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:04.450
If it pleases you, you're up now...

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:17.340
Yeah, get him!

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:19.140
Come on, Joe the Killer!

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:20.720
Take him out like Carlos!

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:23.770
Just like his comeback KO we saw on TV!

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:23.770
<i>Go for it, Joe!</i>

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:25.190
What are you waiting for?

00:10:25.190 --> 00:10:28.480
Punch him! Punch him, Joe!

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:40.070
Carlos... How much power do you really have?

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:45.920
Hey, what's the matter with you, Joe?

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:48.580
Pull yourself together and hit me!

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:51.000
Carlos...

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:53.170
I want to see you get serious.

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:56.590
I want to see you really box.

00:10:59.260 --> 00:11:00.560
Joe! Fight!

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:01.050
Fight!

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:03.470
Hey, what's the holdup?

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:06.690
Gimme back my money!

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:13.360
There he goes again, spaced out in the ring!

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:15.400
Wh-What do we do, Kono-san?

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:17.660
That's what I wanna know!

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:24.290
Come on, Bear! Do something, please!

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:26.450
That's easy for you to say...

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:29.740
Come on, get a move on!

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:31.830
Are you really Joe the Killer?

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:32.380
Joe!

00:11:32.380 --> 00:11:33.220
Hurry it up!

00:11:33.220 --> 00:11:34.340
Good god!

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:37.300
Carlos...

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:43.180
Come on, Joe! Let's see you fight!

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:47.140
Are you really Joe the Killer?

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:51.060
Carlos, what am I supposed to do to get you serious?

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:53.270
Hey, what are you waiting for?

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:55.820
Your opponent's just standing there, so knock him out!

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:59.360
I came here to see a goddamn knockout!

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:59.360
<i>So did I!</i>

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:00.690
Yeah, you might be right.

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:02.740
Here I go, Joe!

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:06.790
That's it.

00:12:06.790 --> 00:12:08.460
If I want to get him serious...

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:10.880
I've got to hit him with a fierce strike,

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:12.710
so he won't have time to put on an act!

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:22.470
I need a punch strong enough to rouse him.

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:25.090
I don't care anymore!

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:26.890
Have it your way!

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:33.860
Excuse me...

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:39.030
There wouldn't happen to be a Yabuki Joe here, would there?

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:44.400
Yeah, he's here, as a matter of fact.

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:51.710
Has he caused any problems?

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:54.960
Hell yes, he has!

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:56.290
By the way...

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:56.710
Who are you?

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:03.720
Joe the Killer's getting his ass kicked!

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:07.180
You think that's really the same Yabuki that killed Rikiishi?

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:09.230
Yeah, I got my doubts!

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:12.600
They think they can fool country bumpkins like us,

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:14.680
so they brought in a fake instead!

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:18.110
Yeah, he's a fake! I want my money back!

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:19.820
Give us the real Joe!

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:39.380
He's been like this ever since he saw Carlos' match on TV.

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:42.670
Carlos' match?

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:47.180
Yeah. The audience is in an uproar, as you can see.

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:48.680
I'm just about to give up here.

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:01.270
Yeah.

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:03.700
I've got to hit him with a fierce strike,

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:05.780
so he doesn't have time to put on an act!

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:40.480
You're so cool! At least you're the real thing!

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:44.820
Joe the Killer, my ass! Get this imposter out of here!

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:56.620
Danpei-san...

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:58.620
I'm leaving.

00:15:00.340 --> 00:15:02.630
Won't you even speak to Joe?

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:05.630
There's nothing I can do for Joe right now.

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:13.230
I can't do a thing, even if I want to.

00:15:22.110 --> 00:15:23.690
Kono-san...

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:25.610
Take good care of Joe.

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:40.700
Good care, huh...

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:42.580
Oh, my pleasure!

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:58.450
Well, these things tend to happen on tours.

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:03.020
Everybody thinks about their future at least once.

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:07.740
And we can't exactly bring Carlos into our petty ring.

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:09.030
Isn't that right, Kono-san?

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.910
But what are we supposed to do now?

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:18.620
What do you say we just give up?

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:19.760
Give up?

00:16:19.760 --> 00:16:22.890
We give Joe back to the big-city ring where Carlos is.

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:28.430
We're all a bunch of failures who've fallen here from that ring.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:34.050
But what's the matter with letting one of us climb back up there?

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:34.940
Well?

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:39.390
Give Joe back to the big-city ring?

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:43.520
He can do it. I know he'll make a comeback.

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:47.690
Guess that's our only choice.

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:50.280
But it'll get pretty lonely around here...

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:52.570
I know...

00:17:09.050 --> 00:17:10.470
What's taking his opponent so long?

00:17:10.470 --> 00:17:12.420
You're not gonna box alone, are you?

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:15.350
Bring in the other one!

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:18.390
How long are you gonna keep us waiting?

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:22.390
The audience is complaining again.

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:25.940
I think you'd better pick up the pace...

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:27.570
We know that already! Shut up!

00:17:27.570 --> 00:17:29.820
Who died and made you the manager?

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:33.080
There's nothing we can do about the audience right now!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:34.400
Right, Ina-chan?

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:38.490
Still, we shouldn't keep Joe waiting.

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:40.830
Well, time to go!

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:48.210
Hey, Ina-chan!

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:51.700
Anything we can do to help?

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:54.680
Just cheer him on.

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:57.630
Give Joe a good, loud cheer.

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:01.980
Joe, huh? Can't believe he's leaving...

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:02.930
You dumbass!

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:05.100
What's with the long face?

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:07.980
Your friend's about to make a big comeback!

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:08.940
For God's sake...

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:12.440
Can't you look happier than that?

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:15.660
All right, finally!

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:33.840
Joe, this is your last fight here!

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.380
I'm gonna give it all I got!

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:01.490
Joe, this is the last time I'm fighting you.

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:03.870
I'd really like to fight you with all I got.

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:08.250
But you don't seem up to that right now.

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:11.830
So I'm sorry, but I'm gonna give you a goodbye, my style.

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:27.810
Here we go, Joe!

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:49.710
Are you awake, Joe?

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:55.050
Now that you're awake, get back to Tokyo as soon as you can.

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:57.760
You're dozing off in the middle of the day because you've spent too much time

00:19:57.760 --> 00:19:59.460
lazing around in the countryside.

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:01.850
Once you get back to Tokyo,

00:20:01.850 --> 00:20:04.350
raise some hell in the big ring.

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:06.020
We'll be looking forward...

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:10.820
to seeing you, a fellow failure like us...

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:14.980
a former touring boxer, fight with all he's got.

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:25.410
That's it, Joe!

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:26.990
We're looking forward to it!

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:28.990
Hey, guys! Let's all lift Joe up into the air!

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:31.040
Yeah!

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:36.050
Here we go!

00:20:36.050 --> 00:20:52.100
Hip-hip-hurrah! Hip-hip-hurrah!

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:54.600
Hey, give it a rest, idiots!

00:20:55.070 --> 00:20:57.610
We didn't come here to see this tripe!

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:59.740
Yeah! We wanna see a fight!

00:20:59.740 --> 00:21:02.610
You can't disappoint your audience!

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:06.110
No, wait! There's a good explanation for this...

00:21:06.110 --> 00:21:09.620
One of our fighters is about to...

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:11.500
Give us our money back!

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:15.060
You thieves!

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:17.250
Looks like they just don't get it.

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:19.130
All right, boys! Fight on!

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:23.970
We've been waiting for this!

00:22:11.730 --> 00:22:13.680
All right, ladies and gentlemen! In honor of one young man,

00:22:14.310 --> 00:22:20.650
who is our friend, our hope, our dream, and our everything,

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:23.530
who is about to make it big time,

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:28.200
I'd like to congratulate our very own Yabuki Joe-kun!

00:22:28.870 --> 00:22:32.290
Now, allow me to start us off.

00:22:32.290 --> 00:22:35.000
Yabuki-kun, hurrah!

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:38.540
Hurrah! Hurrah! Hurrah!

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:40.670
Come on, asshole! You join in, too!

00:22:40.670 --> 00:22:41.590
All right...

00:22:41.590 --> 00:22:44.130
Hurrah!

00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:44.130
<i>Louder!</i>

00:22:44.970 --> 00:22:47.180
Hurrah!

00:22:45.590 --> 00:22:47.180
<i>There!</i>

00:22:48.050 --> 00:22:50.600
Come on, you're doing it, too!

00:22:50.600 --> 00:22:51.720
Hurrah!

00:22:51.720 --> 00:22:52.770
All together, now!

00:22:52.770 --> 00:22:53.480
Hurrah...

00:23:33.770 --> 00:23:36.310
Just you wait, Carlos...

00:23:36.310 --> 00:23:38.700
for the day you'll fight me for real!

00:24:50.010 --> 00:24:53.670
Joe has barged in uninvited to be a sparring partner to the terrifying boxer, Carlos.

00:24:54.220 --> 00:24:56.470
Meanwhile, Carlos tries to gauge Joe's power.

00:24:57.390 --> 00:25:00.440
Sparks fly as the beasts clash!

